              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Naawe, ggwe Ezera, ng'okozesa amagezi Katonda ge yakuwa, londa abaami n'abalamuzi, abanaalamulanga abantu bonna ab'omu ssaza eriri emitala w'omugga Fulaati, abamanyi amateeka ga Katonda wo, era oyigirize n'abo abatagamanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu yenna ataligondera tteeka lya Katonda wo, n'etteeka lya Kabaka aliweebwa ekibonerezo kya kuttibwa, oba okugobebwa mu bantu, oba okuggyibwako ebibye, oba okusibibwa mu kkomera.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
